{
 "version": 1,
 "description": "Declared mutants of the render Module, render_world and sdl_gpu (batches R2a and r2b-2d, v8-arch-gyo2-sdl-r2a and v8-arch-gyo2-sdl-r2b-2d; Design Invariants RD-1 to RD-7 in docs/architecture/target/v2/render.zh-Hant.md, SDL-4, SDL-5 and section 7 in sdl.zh-Hant.md; ids rd-, rw-, sg-, gp-, p2-, re-). The gp- mutants need a GPU (label gpu: a machine with one, or Lavapipe). A mutant is killed only when the named test case fails with the expected message.",
